{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32218","headline":"赠袁司录 · 温庭筠","name":"赠袁司录","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一朝辞满有心期，花发杨园雪压枝。\n刘尹故人谙往事，谢郎诸弟得新知。\n金钗醉就胡姬画，玉管闲留洛客吹。\n记得襄阳耆旧语，不堪风景岘山碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}